      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it's a decent start but it feels a bit too cautious if you ask me. the attending is gonna want to know if we can actually narrow this down based on what we see here. i mean, the ST depression and the troponin being up isn't exactly \"maybe.\"\n\ncan you try a version that's more assertive about the primary suspected diagnosis? the automated tool gave it a very low score (it only caught \"clear\"). just try to make the diagnostic reasoning feel more conclusive without being medically wrong. i really need that certainty score to be a bit higher so it doesn't get flagged as 'undetermined' in the system. just be careful not to lose the nuance, but be more decisive.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
